title: 'spec-msg: included-root receiver and collator wiring'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: Fetch and verify messages under included roots and wire receiver inherents and lifts
    into collation. Retry unwritten streams and refresh channel coverage when the included root
    changes. Replay unfinalized consumption after a restart and track recovery sources until their
    consuming blocks finalize.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-collator
  bump: major
- name: cumulus-client-spec-msg
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
